  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility study for Transmission Grid Strenghtening Palma-Metoro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Mozambique has signed MoUs for initial domestic gas user projects that will form the nucleus on which to build a gas-based economy in Mozambiqque. This committs GoM to deliver on certain project preparatory activities, with confirmation of a reliable electricity grid solution beign one such key early activity. The strenghtening of the electricity transmission grid between Palma and Metoro is one such activity. This projects support the feasibility study for this activity.</narrative>
  </description>
